com/users/xiaoyu2er/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiaoyu2er/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiaoyu2er","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoyu2er/nextjs-i18n-docs/commits/f7fc4e5d44c8867544ba9c4993faf1494f9c4a72/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-19T04:24:00Z","email":"yzong@turo.com","name":"yanqi.zong"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-19T04:35:05Z","email":"zongyanqi@gmail.com","name":"Yanqi Zong"},"message":"feat: migrate CI/CD from GitHub Actions to Cloudflare Builds\n\n- Remove .github/workflows/deploy-cf.yml (GitHub Actions deploy)\n- Add account_id to all wrangler.toml files (0b41676...)\n- Add custom domain routes for nextjs.im on Router Worker\n- Add 301 redirects: locale subdomains → path prefix\n  (e.g. zh-hans.nextjs.im/docs/... → nextjs.im/zh-hans/docs/...)\n\nCF Builds config (per Worker in Dashboard → Settings → Build):\n\n  nextjs-docs-latest:\n    root: /\n    build: bun install && cd apps/web && bun run prepare-content && NODE_OPTIONS=''--max-old-space-size=8192'' bun run astro build\n    deploy: cd apps/web && npx wrangler deploy\n    watch: apps/web/*, packages/shared/*, content/*/docs/01-*, content/*/docs/02-*, scripts/*\n\n  nextjs-docs-v{13,14,15}:\n    root: /\n    build: bun install && cd apps/web-v && VERSION={N} bun run build\n    deploy: cd apps/web-v && VERSION={N} npx wrangler deploy --name nextjs-docs-v{N}\n    watch: apps/web-v/*, packages/shared/*, content/*/docs/{N}/*, scripts/*\n\n  nextjs-docs-router:\n    root: apps/router/\n    build: (none)\n    deploy: npx wrangler deploy\n    watch: apps/router/*","tree":{"sha":"856648c56f4619ad1d3ab838d56fa41892bb9e97","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoyu2er/nextjs-i18n-docs/git/trees/856648c56f4619ad1d3ab838d56fa41892bb9e97"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiaoyu2er/nextjs-i18n-docs/git/commits/f7fc4e5d44c8867544ba9c4993faf1494f9c4a72","ver