,"message":"Add navigation item for LLM Inference Services\n\nThe new item is added after InferenceServices. Also, an Events tab is configured for LLMIsvcs. It was possible to use the same Events components from InferenceServices, so it was renamed.","tree":{"sha":"9b76ee2c18fad879e18b7ae24a106d0b1ebc4d32","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/israel-hdez/ai-serving-osc-plugin/git/trees/9b76ee2c18fad879e18b7ae24a106d0b1ebc4d32"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/israel-hdez/ai-serving-osc-plugin/git/commits/7e146281c7ac2168eb6054b438f62b20cabeda21","verification":{"payload":"tree 9b76ee2c18fad879e18b7ae24a106d0b1ebc4d32\nparent 61bcdebb86ccd311e86c5dd89636d18455b28c88\nauthor Edgar Hernández <23639005+israel-hdez@users.noreply.github.com> 1756772698 -0600\ncommitter Edgar Hernández <23639005+israel-hdez@users.noreply.github.com> 1756772698 -0600\n\nAdd navigation item for LLM Inference Services\n\nThe new item is added after InferenceServices. Also, an Events tab is configured for LLMIsvcs. It was possible to use the same Events components from InferenceServices, so it was renamed.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQEzBAABCgAdFiEEnGHwpRErOGBZwO1NpuuSx/eiN04FAmi2OVoACgkQpuuSx/ei\nN06Zhwf/SaJkm4RGBgehVa2ca6FcKn5ceQfwGJcWzl3p4eeZhdtZ/s5s1UikKRim\ni/undfbhdWNZXavSo4kDxS1qca2oVMaM7BHkvqIAVOhpP8YDWmWZlmId5NDAqspE\nqmcF1vg15lKbkaJb2vHzIegygw/nyqH4P0S5OYppQ7moXkRz7y+0/ZNw64wjVsxD\nToIX1HqA0MWJpDkP2fprW1P/hlW7LUG07/jHVKwKlEIWQFxLi+13XdE1KEJbsrEo\ng56fvcExHDXBxLS19sveB/V4d086sklyU225tJXV98nDZHihRtQRk7DpV6ROY7N/\nLLPZrBhY3iW60SUuFOykKt/tyRou4Q==\n=xoM/\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-09-02T00:25:03Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23639005?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/israel-hdez/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/israel-hdez/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/israel-hdez/following{/other_user}","gists_ur