/users/israel-hdez/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/israel-hdez/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/israel-hdez","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/israel-hdez/ai-serving-osc-plugin/commit/54659e9b4742c574ec0d01564fa3716399b6c0ea","node_id":"C_kwDOOnYU-doAKDU0NjU5ZTliNDc0MmM1NzRlYzBkMDE1NjRmYTM3MTYzOTliNmMwZWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/israel-hdez/ai-serving-osc-plugin/commit/f15e542969efeb475a421d745a89ca0378fbb36b","sha":"f15e542969efeb475a421d745a89ca0378fbb36b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/israel-hdez/ai-serving-osc-plugin/commits/f15e542969efeb475a421d745a89ca0378fbb36b"}],"sha":"54659e9b4742c574ec0d01564fa3716399b6c0ea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/israel-hdez/ai-serving-osc-plugin/commits/54659e9b4742c574ec0d01564fa3716399b6c0ea"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23639005?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/israel-hdez/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/israel-hdez/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/israel-hdez/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/israel-hdez/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/israel-hdez","id":23639005,"login":"israel-hdez","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzNjM5MDA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/israel-hdez/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/israel-hdez/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/israel-hdez/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/israel-hdez/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/israel-hdez/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/israel-hdez","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/israel-hdez/ai-serving-osc-plugin/commits/f15e542969efeb475a421d745a89ca0378fbb36b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-07-07T01:17:36Z","email":"23639005+israel-hdez@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Edgar Hernández"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-07-07T01:17:36Z","email":"23639005+israel-hdez@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Edgar Hernández"},"message":"Add navigation to ServingRuntime and set plugin metadata in ConsoleRemotePlugin\n\nThese changes add a new top-level section in the left main navigation of OpenShift console. The new navigation is going to be below `Workloads`. Inside of it, a navigation item for Serving Runtimes is added. At the moment, OpenShift default list and details pages are used.\n\nAdditionally, the plugin metadata is now being specified in `ConsoleRemotePlugin` (in webpack.config.ts):\n* The console-extensions.json is no longer used and, instead, the extensions are configured in the new console-extensions.ts file.\n* The `consolePlugin` is also no longer used and, instead, the metadata is specified directly `ConsoleRemotePlugin` in webpack.config.ts file.","tree":{"sha":"1b66866ea6d8b221e06e354fe49dd272ff4dfa27","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/israel-hdez/ai-serving-osc-plugin/git/trees/1b66866ea6d8b221e06e354fe49dd272ff4dfa27"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/israel-hdez/ai-serving-osc-plugin/git/commits/f15e542969efeb475a421d745a89ca0378fbb36b","verification":{"payload":"tree 1b66866ea6d8b221e06e354fe49dd272ff4dfa27\nparent efd9c472832c68e6f407eae34078d9ea87a354c0\nauthor Edgar Hernández <23639005+israel-hdez@users.noreply.github.com> 1751851056 -0600\ncommitter Edgar Hernández <23639005+israel-hdez@users.noreply.github.com> 1751851056 -0600\n\nAdd navigation to ServingRuntime and set plugin metadata in ConsoleRemotePlugin\n\nThese changes add a new top-level section in the left main navigation of OpenShift console. The new navigation is going to be below `Workloads`. Inside of it, a navigation item for Serving Runtimes is added. At the moment, OpenShift default list and details pages are used.\n\nAdditionally, the plugin metadata is now being specified in `ConsoleRemotePlugin` (in webpack.config.ts):\n* The console-extensions.json is no longer used and, instead, the extensions are configured in the new console-extensions.ts file.\n* The `consolePlugin` is also no longer used and, instead, the metadata is specified directly `ConsoleRemotePlugin` in webpack.config.ts file.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQEzBAABCgAdFiEEnGHwpRErOGBZwO1NpuuSx/eiN04FAmhrIDAACgkQpuuSx/ei\nN07gewf9E6cACpZFaAjMiqjfKDARhUwih522zWFlbVd8LYDSdN+3fPZTWI25nQC2\ni8CZydXcohJbZr6jaA6V1ce1cJf4pwIbUK5HnMZVV+iP2x/IlIo6orqGTTUQepMD\nw6XDvBiV3bCMeYARCfKKRRAkERLNU2+4mvscN94j8Ksmfv8yeQboH6Rit9myNVX4\n5O1O1AiUOVza7mTXLnoUwulCyk5lRMJTxv4aMjfNjzcP+yzPy+8Pxzuysey6vom2\nAuJxATMyGEh0kRvZa8Y5R9BGmEN8N5+7th1EUvLphlEI6K8kQ4U0kCrOFbglX7PP\nmT2YrJavLdTvnbRdRaPGjJEkwWncxg==\n=D0/F\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-07-07T02:18:01Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23639005?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/israel-hdez/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/israel-hdez/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/israel-hdez/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/israel-hdez/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/israel-hdez","id":23639005,"login":"israel-hdez","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzNjM5MDA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/israel-hdez/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/israel-hdez/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/israel-hdez/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/israel-hdez/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/israel-hdez/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/israel-hdez","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/israel-hdez/ai-serving-osc-p