nts","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-26T23:35:39Z","email":"alex10mtz_rivera@outlook.com","name":"Alejandro Martínez Rivera"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-26T23:35:39Z","email":"alex10mtz_rivera@outlook.com","name":"Alejandro Martínez Rivera"},"message":"fix: resolv auth 401/500 errors by aligning Sanctum, Nginx proxy, and database pooling\n\n- Updated sanctum.php to correctly handle stateful domains for SPA authentication.\n- Configured Nginx proxy headers (X-Forwarded-Host/Proto) to ensure proper CSRF and session matching.\n- Disabled PDO prepared statements in database.php to support Supabase (PgBouncer) transaction pooling.\n- Optimized bootstrap/app.php middleware to trust proxies and handle CORS correctly within Docker.\n- Cleared application and configuration cache to enforce environment variable updates.\n\nFixes: Internal Server Error (SQLSTATE 26000) and 401 Unauthorized on dashboard routes.","tree":{"sha":"5f62d4aa6948905b1f177e69c1c80249c641d196","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlejandroMtz10/spendo/git/trees/5f62d4aa6948905b1f177e69c1c80249c641d196"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlejandroMtz10/spendo/git/commits/544f54921b15f4469e445f1a8fc7f2cf33e4b661","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/107456879?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlejandroMtz10/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlejandroMtz10/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlejandroMtz10/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlejandroMtz10/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AlejandroMtz10","id":107456879,"login":"AlejandroMtz10","node_id":"U_kgDOBmepbw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlejandroMtz10/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlejandroMtz10/received_events","re