T23:22:28Z","email":"alex10mtz_rivera@outlook.com","name":"Alejandro Martínez Rivera"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-20T23:22:28Z","email":"alex10mtz_rivera@outlook.com","name":"Alejandro Martínez Rivera"},"message":"Feat: Add dashboard summary controller and routes\n\nFeat: Create SummaryController with three endpoints for dashboard data and register them under /dashboard. getMainDashboard returns total balance, current month income/expense and the latest 5 transactions (uses TransactionsResource). getExpenseAnalysis returns expenses grouped by category for the current month and a quick comparison with last month. getSavingsDashboard returns account distribution and a 6-month savings trend (income vs expense) using TO_CHAR/EXTRACT in the query. Routes added to routes/api.php to expose /dashboard/main, /dashboard/expenses and /dashboard/savings.","tree":{"sha":"74302fded85c895cd87219bb2437ac0e2c054cee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlejandroMtz10/spendo/git/trees/74302fded85c895cd87219bb2437ac0e2c054cee"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlejandroMtz10/spendo/git/commits/117b16bedcdcce7db02f64634d8381e751c6c077","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/107456879?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlejandroMtz10/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlejandroMtz10/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlejandroMtz10/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlejandroMtz10/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AlejandroMtz10","id":107456879,"login":"AlejandroMtz10","node_id":"U_kgDOBmepbw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlejandroMtz10/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlejandroMtz10/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlejandroMtz10/repos","