ser","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlejandroMtz10","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlejandroMtz10/spendo/commits/ff9afcc608199db847768e1147ee21ff6a96680a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-18T21:46:10Z","email":"alex10mtz_rivera@outlook.com","name":"Alejandro Martínez Rivera"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-18T21:46:10Z","email":"alex10mtz_rivera@outlook.com","name":"Alejandro Martínez Rivera"},"message":"Feat: Add CategoryRequest for category validation\n\nFeat: Introduce a new FormRequest (CategoryRequest) to centralize validation and sanitization for category create/update operations. Key points:\n- Allows authorization universally (authorize returns true).\n- Validates optional category_id as uuid and normalizes route param whether it''s an object or id for update ignores.\n- Enforces name: required|string|max:255 and unique per user (Rule::unique scoped by user_id, ignoring current category_id when updating).\n- Enforces type: required and must be exactly one of ''Ingreso'' or ''Gasto''.\n- Adds Spanish validation messages for name uniqueness and type constraint.\n- prepareForValidation sanitizes and normalizes name and type (trim, strip_tags, capitalize) before validation.\nThis centralizes category input rules and ensures user-scoped uniqueness and consistent type values.","tree":{"sha":"22f6e4045863b39ea8ce9641cf4eec14ae83f57d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlejandroMtz10/spendo/git/trees/22f6e4045863b39ea8ce9641cf4eec14ae83f57d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlejandroMtz10/spendo/git/commits/ff9afcc608199db847768e1147ee21ff6a96680a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/107456879?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlejandroMtz10/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlejandroMtz10/followers","following