r","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlejandroMtz10","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlejandroMtz10/spendo/commits/39f882d702d01d976ce94f82a19f0c1b212c1c42/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-16T21:42:16Z","email":"alex10mtz_rivera@outlook.com","name":"Alejandro Martínez Rivera"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-16T21:42:16Z","email":"alex10mtz_rivera@outlook.com","name":"Alejandro Martínez Rivera"},"message":"Feat: Add Currency FormRequest and Resource\n\nFeat: Introduce CurrencyRequest to validate currency payloads (code_currency: required|string|max:3, currency: required|string|max:255) with custom error messages, and add CurrenciesResource to serialize currency models as { code_currency, currency }. These additions provide request validation and a consistent JSON representation for currency endpoints.","tree":{"sha":"d0c1062ff470b94a3a097a6a98950a946d880a65","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlejandroMtz10/spendo/git/trees/d0c1062ff470b94a3a097a6a98950a946d880a65"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlejandroMtz10/spendo/git/commits/39f882d702d01d976ce94f82a19f0c1b212c1c42","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/107456879?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlejandroMtz10/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlejandroMtz10/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlejandroMtz10/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlejandroMtz10/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AlejandroMtz10","id":107456879,"login":"AlejandroMtz10","node_id":"U_kgDOBmepbw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlejandroMtz10/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlejandroMtz10/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlejandroMtz10/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlejandroMtz10/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlejandroMtz10/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlejandroMtz10","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AlejandroMtz10/spendo/commit/39f882d702d01d976ce94f82a19f0c1b212c1c42","node_id":"C_kwDOOn2yotoAKDM5Zjg4MmQ3MDJkMDFkOTc2Y2U5NGY4MmExOWYwYzFiMjEyYzFjNDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AlejandroMtz10/spendo/commit/ce1247096322a47a8e41646f227c40267c566a57","sha":"ce1247096322a47a8e41646f227c40267c566a57","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlejandroMtz10/spendo/commits/ce1247096322a47a8e41646f227c40267c566a57"}],"sha":"39f882d702d01d976ce94f82a19f0c1b212c1c42","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlejandroMtz10/spendo/commits/39f882d702d01d976ce94f82a19f0c1b212c1c42"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/107456879?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlejandroMtz10/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlejandroMtz10/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlejandroMtz10/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlejandroMtz10/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AlejandroMtz10","id":107456879,"login":"AlejandroMtz10","node_id":"U_kgDOBmepbw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlejandroMtz10/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlejandroMtz10/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlejandroMtz10/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlejandroMtz10/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlejandroMtz10/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlejandroMtz10","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlejandroMtz10/spendo/commits/ce1247096322a47a8e41646f227c40267c566a57/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-14T02:52:00Z","email":"alex10mtz_rivera@outlook.com","name":"Alejandro Martínez Rivera"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-14T02:52:00Z","email":"alex10mtz_rivera@outlook.com","name":"Alejandro Martínez Rivera"},"message":"Feat: Move transaction validation to FormRequest\n\nFeat: Introduce TransactionRequest to encapsulate validation rules tied to the authenticated user and update TransactionController::store to accept it. Validation is now retrieved via $request->validated(); the controller no longer performs inline validation. The store method still wraps creation and account balance updates in a DB::transaction and uses lockForUpdate on the account to avoid races. Also import TransactionRequest and return the TransactionsResource directly (removed explicit response()->json(…, 201)).","tree":{"sha":"25b7c7d6fdb5d60cf279f6194b392fa5f8a53246","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlejandroMtz10/spendo/git/trees/25b7c7d6fdb5d60cf279f6194b392fa5f8a53246"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlejandroMtz10/spendo/git/commits/ce1247096322a47a8e41646f227c40267c566a57","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/107456879?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlejandroMtz10/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlejandroMtz10/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlejandroMtz10/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlejandroMtz10/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AlejandroMtz10","id":107456879,"login":"AlejandroMtz10","node_id":"U_kgDOBmepbw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlejandroMtz10/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlejandroMtz10/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlejandroMtz10/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlejandroMtz10/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlejandroMtz10/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlejandroMtz10","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AlejandroMtz10/spendo/commit/ce1247096322a47a8e41646f227c40267c566a57","node_id":"C_kwDOOn2yotoAKGNlMTI0NzA5NjMyMmE0N2E4ZTQxNjQ2ZjIyN2M0MDI2N2M1NjZhNTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AlejandroMtz10/spendo/commit/a782c35dd809732682cad16544f4704d53f7bbd9","sha":"a782c35dd809732682cad16544f4704d53f7bbd9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlejandroMtz10/spendo/commits/a782c35dd809732682cad16544f4704d53f7bbd9"}],"sha":"ce1247096322a47a8e41646f227c40267c566a57","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlejandroMtz10/spendo/commits/ce1247096322a47a8e41646f227c40267c566a57"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/107456879?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlejandroMtz10/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlejandroMtz10/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlejandroMtz10/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlejandroMtz10/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AlejandroMtz10","id":107456879,"login":"AlejandroMtz10","node_id":"U_kgDOBmepbw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlejandroMtz10/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlejandroMtz10/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlejandroMtz10/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlejandroMtz10/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlejandroMtz10/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlejandroMtz10","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlejandroMtz10/spendo/commits/a782c35dd809732682cad16544f4704d53f7bbd9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-13T02:47:23Z","email":"alex10mtz_rivera@outlook.com","name":"Alejandro Martínez Rivera"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-13T02:47:23Z","email":"alex10mtz_rivera@outlook.com","name":"Alejandro Martínez Rivera"},"message":"Feat: Add methods CRUD to transactions controller and add resource\n\nFeat: Enhance TransactionController with authorization, user-scoped validation, DB transactions and row locking to ensure data integrity. Index/show/store/update/destroy now return TransactionsResource; store and destroy adjust account balances inside DB::transaction and use lockForUpdate to avoid race conditions. Validation tightened (account/category existence scoped to the user, added required date) and update/destroy use policy authorization. Add TransactionsResource to transform transaction output (includes formatted created_at).","tree":{"sha":"b86ead3954e676d7c9e99080dd0156544e24448e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlejandroMtz10/spendo/git/trees/b86ead3954e676d7c9e99080dd0156544e24448e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlejandroMtz10/spendo/git/commits/a782c35dd809732682cad16544f4704d53f7bbd9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/107456879?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlejandroMtz10/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlejandroMtz10/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlejandroMtz10/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlejandroMtz10/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AlejandroMtz10","id":107456879,"login":"AlejandroMtz10","node_id":"U_kgDOBmepbw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlejandroMtz10/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlejandroMtz10/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlejandroMtz10/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlejandroMtz10/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlejandroMtz10/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlejandroMtz10","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AlejandroMtz10/spendo/commit/a782c35dd809732682cad16544f4704d53f7bbd9","node_id":"C_kwDOOn2yotoAKGE3ODJjMzVkZDgwOTczMjY4MmNhZDE2NTQ0ZjQ3MDRkNTNmN2JiZDk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AlejandroMtz10/spendo/commit/12459da8bd7132da918b04c73c5f1c9f29b7ac63","sha":"12459da8bd7132da918b04c73c5f1c9f29b7ac63","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlejandroMtz10/spendo/commits/12459da8bd7132da918b04c73c5f1c9f29b7ac63"}],"sha":"a782c35dd809732682cad16544f4704d53f7bbd9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlejandroMtz10/spendo/commits/a782c35dd809732682cad16544f4704d53f7bbd9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/107456879?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlejandroMtz10/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlejandroMtz10/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlejandroMtz10/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlejandroMtz10/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AlejandroMtz10","id":107456879,"login":"AlejandroMtz10","node_id":"U_kgDOBmepbw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlejandroMtz10/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlejandroMtz10/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlejandroMtz10/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlejandroMtz10/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlejandroMtz10/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlejandroMtz10","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlejandroMtz10/spendo/commits/12459da8bd7132da918b04c73c5f1c9f29b7ac63/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-12T01:31:39Z","email":"alex10mtz_rivera@outlook.com","name":"Alejandro Martínez Rivera"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-12T01:31:39Z","email":"alex10mtz_rivera@outlook.com","name":"Alejandro Martínez Rivera"},"message":"Add API controllers, auth and Sanctum setup\n\nScaffold API controllers for accounts, transactions, categories and currencies. Add AuthController with register/login/logout using Laravel Sanctum; update User model to include HasApiTokens and change fillable from `full_name` to `name`. Replace/update personal_access_tokens migration to use `uuidMorphs` and add a new migration file. Update API routes to include auth endpoints and apiResource routes. Add ER diagram SVG, rename SQL dump, and apply minor bootstrap/provider whitespace fixes.","tree":{"sha":"83ef9b4d0d5a59b4a878202ee4853b1280c43c15","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlejandroMtz10/spendo/git/trees/83ef9b4d0d5a59b4a878202ee4853b1280c43c15"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlejandroMtz10/spendo/git/commits/12459da8bd7132da918b04c73c5f1c9f29b7ac63","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/107456879?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlejandroMtz10/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlejandroMtz10/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlejandroMtz10/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlejandroMtz10/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AlejandroMtz10","id":107456879,"login":"AlejandroMtz10","node_id":"U_kgDOBmepbw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlejandroMtz10/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlejandroMtz10/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlejandroMtz10/repos",