de746a9d4db1889/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-11T02:31:40Z","email":"alex10mtz_rivera@outlook.com","name":"Alejandro Martínez Rivera"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-11T02:31:40Z","email":"alex10mtz_rivera@outlook.com","name":"Alejandro Martínez Rivera"},"message":"Feat: Add finance models and migrations\n\nFeat: Introduce Account, Category, Currency and Transaction Eloquent models and corresponding migrations. User model and users migration were updated to use UUID primary key (user_id), HasUuids, and a renamed/adjusted fillable field (full_name). New migrations create currencies (char code_currency PK), accounts, categories and transactions tables with UUID primary keys, relationships, foreign keys (with cascade deletes where appropriate), and appropriate columns/casts (e.g. Transaction date and decimal amount). Models include fillable attributes, relationships, and key configuration (UUIDs or char PKs) to match the schema.","tree":{"sha":"96debff20ce6eaad945defac36f472ebee2eb626","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlejandroMtz10/spendo/git/trees/96debff20ce6eaad945defac36f472ebee2eb626"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlejandroMtz10/spendo/git/commits/8cef66360eed4084a51e006a8de746a9d4db1889","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/107456879?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlejandroMtz10/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlejandroMtz10/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlejandroMtz10/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlejandroMtz10/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AlejandroMtz10","id":107456879,"login":"AlejandroMtz10","node_id":"U_kgDOBmepbw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlejandroMtz10/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/