//api.github.com/users/chiefnayeem/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chiefnayeem/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chiefnayeem","id":25279877,"login":"chiefnayeem","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1Mjc5ODc3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chiefnayeem/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chiefnayeem/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chiefnayeem/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chiefnayeem/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chiefnayeem/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chiefnayeem","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiefnayeem/chiefnayeem/commits/25219e845a79f4bbd1a017b801d7d1fc7a2a0597/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T21:11:33Z","email":"chiefnayeem@gmail.com","name":"Mohammed Nayeem"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-03T21:11:33Z","email":"chiefnayeem@gmail.com","name":"Mohammed Nayeem"},"message":"Frame the two public projects as samples, not the whole body of work\n\nNaming exactly two things implied those were the only two, which makes a\nsmall-town app with 300 users read as the sum of nine years. It is not —\nit is the part that happens to be installable.\n\nThe intro now says most of the work lives in private client repositories\nand these two are simply the public ones, and the Shipped section lists the\ncontract platforms without naming clients. Same facts, and the reader stops\ninferring scarcity from the absence of links.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"40192746f1b01be070bad72e6effd6c9e0a145d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiefnayeem/chiefnayeem/git/trees/40192746f1b01be070bad72e6effd6c9e0a145d6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiefnayeem/chiefnayeem/git/commits/25219e845a79f4bbd1a017b801d7d1fc7a2a0597"