{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chiefnayeem/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chiefnayeem","id":25279877,"login":"chiefnayeem","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1Mjc5ODc3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chiefnayeem/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chiefnayeem/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chiefnayeem/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chiefnayeem/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chiefnayeem/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chiefnayeem","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiefnayeem/chiefnayeem/commits/0458cf5d91a77f87773586e7763b649ee08e9b3a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T21:10:36Z","email":"chiefnayeem@gmail.com","name":"Mohammed Nayeem"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-03T21:10:36Z","email":"chiefnayeem@gmail.com","name":"Mohammed Nayeem"},"message":"Promote Laravel/PHP to core, and add marks to the stack table\n\nLaravel was in the second tier, which understated it: four years leading an\neCommerce build on it at eDorpon, plus DeshiCommerce and two other client\nplatforms since. Framed by what makes it interesting rather than apologised\nfor — modernising Blade apps in place instead of rewriting them.\n\nSmall technology marks on each core row, from cdn.simpleicons.org with\nexplicit hex so nothing disappears against either GitHub theme. One per\nrow, 17px. Deliberately not applied to the breadth list, where twenty-five\nof them would be the badge wall this profile is trying not to be.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5ec7baabe9c8d021dad12f4e863987ce50be1147","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiefnayeem/chiefnayeem/git/trees/5ec7baabe9c8d021dad12f4e863987ce50be1147"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiefnayeem/chie