om/users/chiefnayeem/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chiefnayeem/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chiefnayeem/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chiefnayeem/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chiefnayeem","id":25279877,"login":"chiefnayeem","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1Mjc5ODc3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chiefnayeem/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chiefnayeem/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chiefnayeem/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chiefnayeem/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chiefnayeem/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chiefnayeem","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiefnayeem/chiefnayeem/commits/19d3398f0ff6e88d6e0e26b6ad7c02d7d26b28c9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T21:05:51Z","email":"chiefnayeem@gmail.com","name":"Mohammed Nayeem"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-03T21:05:51Z","email":"chiefnayeem@gmail.com","name":"Mohammed Nayeem"},"message":"Trim MyGouripur on the GitHub profile — the code is private\n\nOn GitHub the next action a reader takes is opening the repo. redis-graph-cache\nrewards that; MyGouripur''s four repos are private, so a long section about\ncode nobody can click into reads off-register here. The same text works on\nthe CV and the portfolio, which are narrative surfaces.\n\nCut to what is verifiable from this page: it shipped, here are the links,\nit runs on the package above. The write-up stays on the site and is linked.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"932516aee31e5a3a132afe3cb04cd093a182c1cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiefnayeem/chiefnayeem/git/trees/932516aee31e5a3a132afe3cb04cd093a182c1cb"},"url":"https://api.