acy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DJJones66/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DJJones66/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DJJones66/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DJJones66","id":45010408,"login":"DJJones66","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MDEwNDA4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DJJones66/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DJJones66/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DJJones66/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DJJones66/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DJJones66/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DJJones66","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BrainDriveAI/BrainDrive-Core/commits/863e39d8a22a521aa126e33d785fde8e29c88b38/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-13T18:46:59Z","email":"45010408+DJJones66@users.noreply.github.com","name":"DJJones66"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-13T18:46:59Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Add internal service authentication, audit logging, and endpoint ownership enforcement (#214)\n\n* phase 1 done except (1.0.5 and 1.0.7)\n\n* Update package.json\n\n* Update update.md to remove testing details\n\nRemoved testing section and provided next steps for rerunning tests.\n\n* Updated security features: rate limiting, service authentication, and internal endpoints\n\n- Added rate limiting to prevent brute force attacks and API abuse\n- Implemented service authentication for internal endpoints\n- Created internal endpoint structure for service-to-service communication\n- Added request size enforcement middleware\n- Improved authentication context and ownership helpers\n- Removed hardcoded encryption keys for better security\n- All security features tested and verified\n\n* Delete update.md\n\n* Remove Phase 1.0 implementation details from SECURITY_RULES\n\nRemoved Phase 1.0 implementation details from the document.\n\n* Revise security pattern validation script\n\nUpdated script to reflect changes in security guardrails.\n\n* feat: add security audit logging system with request correlation\n\n- Add RequestIdMiddleware for X-Request-ID header generation and propagation\n- Create audit_logs table with comprehensive event schema\n- Implement AuditLogger service with non-blocking background writes\n- Add strict redaction policy for sensitive data (tokens, passwords, API keys)\n- Hook audit logging into auth/service dependencies for 401/403 events\n- Log admin actions (settings CRUD, diagnostics access)\n- Log plugin lifecycle events (install, uninstall, update)\n- Log job lifecycle events (created, completed, failed, canceled)\n- Add database migration for audit_logs table with indexes\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: navaneethkrishnansuresh <navaneethks.official@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"31a4363dc135731e278b4f465e050f34eb66f4c7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BrainDriveAI/BrainDrive-Core/git/trees/31a4363dc135731e278b4f465e050f34eb66f4c7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BrainDriveAI/BrainDrive-Core/git/commits/863e39d8a22a521aa126e33d785fde8e29c88b38","verification":{"payload":"tree 31a4363dc135731e278b4f465e050f34eb66f4c7\nparent f5218edc213e84914ce3881a16661031e1eab5ce\nauthor DJJones66 <45010408+DJJones66@users.noreply.github.com> 1768330019 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1768330019 -0500\n\nAdd internal service authentication, audit logging, and endpoint ownership enforcement (#214)\n\n* phase 1 done except (1.0.5 and 1.0.7)\n\n* Update package.json\n\n* Update update.md to remove testing details\n\nRemoved testing section and provided next steps for rerunning tests.\n\n* Updated security features: rate limiting, service authentication, and internal endpoints\n\n- Added rate limiting to prevent brute force attacks and API abuse\n- Implemented service authentication for internal endpoints\n- Created internal endpoint structure for service-to-service communication\n- Added request size enforcement middleware\n- Improved authentication context and ownership helpers\n- Removed hardcoded encryption keys for better security\n- All security features tested and verified\n\n* Delete update.md\n\n* Remove Phase 1.0 implementation details from SECURITY_RULES\n\nRemoved Phase 1.0 implementation details from the document.\n\n* Revise security pattern validation script\n\nUpdated script to reflect changes in security guardrails.\n\n* feat: add security audit logging system with request correlation\n\n- Add RequestIdMiddleware for X-Request-ID header generation and propagation\n- Create audit_logs table with comprehensive event schema\n- Implement AuditLogger service with non-blocking background writes\n- Add strict redaction policy for sensitive data (tokens, passwords, API keys)\n- Hook audit logging into auth/service dependencies for 401/403 events\n- Log admin actions (settings CRUD, diagnostics access)\n- Log plugin lifecycle events (install, uninstall, update)\n- Log job lifecycle events (created, completed, failed, canceled)\n- Add database migration for audit_logs table with indexes\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: navaneethkrishnansuresh <navaneethks.official@gmail.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpZpMjCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAwEAQAK4k+L/5vIzN/j8rL52cmZOh\nawFDgHEn2qK14+a+j31pBYinjOYzhcSpPuHC6Rp0WA/II5iDoukE+51jDNjzifEN\n0kki/NouZBJcFdVc+CEs3bbMTeswEYG03Y9NkF1N5f4q4iAIOD05sZTw29gLhT03\n/h+PQnfV+APcbm+p2lqxwjDDzAmzNFJTBu7k75+53AG4gPI7Tv4g+H7xEVNfIHQF\nId/kwmdoP6tl/+QmvIb1xxzGmQ9ysQB2VA3a9b9RsENS6pfSpMB33ZNssMXKhtuo\nmohGHM+QdHfUbtHhsiSiqc16i0+dRarvoXQdvojbC9DhMCmCfynQWKt5V1AGpP3F\nRu8j6+odhYCgNjJNNydc4fInnKpRb9hNiR6aRwWmNDoa2jy4UGqMWHsXSSkqdpCw\npIKTgk+DSy5Y3kVUJ+GpnObwWehU3vd+DlLDuhjfYHyHaPVdR7wNXmZc/LYCW8rv\nCxAQ3aNzZ2JrA/2/YSJb17LtGw6KNeJQJrxtnpGLPFwyYTTC