ona parameters correctly to Ollama API format (#193)\n\nFixes #192\n\n- Add _build_ollama_options() method to properly map BrainDrive/OpenAI-style\n  parameters to Ollama format\n- Map context_window -> num_ctx to ensure full context window is used\n- Map max_tokens -> num_predict for token generation limits\n- Map frequency_penalty/presence_penalty -> repeat_penalty\n- Wrap all parameters in ''options'' object per Ollama API specification\n- Replace emoji characters with [OLLAMA] prefix for Windows compatibility\n- Add comprehensive unit test suite with 14 tests (100% passing)\n\nThis ensures personas apply correctly with Ollama models, preventing\nsystem prompt truncation and enabling proper RAG functionality.","tree":{"sha":"0ce89a0b1dc7fb7481e219e902f8554d2e64a4f7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BrainDriveAI/BrainDrive-Core/git/trees/0ce89a0b1dc7fb7481e219e902f8554d2e64a4f7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BrainDriveAI/BrainDrive-Core/git/commits/55ac9c19f8e5494c996c7f8942e4352a1654dfc7","verification":{"payload":"tree 0ce89a0b1dc7fb7481e219e902f8554d2e64a4f7\nparent f4beabd410fe44a35c53d14bf914ce609673233d\nauthor Beck Bekmyradov <47065940+bekmuradov@users.noreply.github.com> 1762856228 +0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1762856228 +0400\n\nfix: Map persona parameters correctly to Ollama API format (#193)\n\nFixes #192\n\n- Add _build_ollama_options() method to properly map BrainDrive/OpenAI-style\n  parameters to Ollama format\n- Map context_window -> num_ctx to ensure full context window is used\n- Map max_tokens -> num_predict for token generation limits\n- Map frequency_penalty/presence_penalty -> repeat_penalty\n- Wrap all parameters in ''options'' object per Ollama API specification\n- Replace emoji characters with [OLLAMA] prefix for Windows compatibility\n- Add comprehensive unit test suite with 14 tests (100% passing)\n\nThis ensures personas apply correctly with Ollama models, preventing\nsystem prompt truncation and enabling prope